{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 588,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39c1a6e3e911c64cc8ca4c44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会争取胜利，但不会让自己抱着\\n非赢不可的压力。总之，看着我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee49907c7ab2e255ca692e9b111244e445d7794768477dd3c4d50c891b235927",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90bc3c1322ab1eb319556b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很令人兴奋对吧！但不论对手是谁，\\n我都只会照自己喜欢的方式去跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f427b7893c1c77256c836a5ea804ecf1503486429d9d60c6e33d3b31bab5cf5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fe70d45381a342f3aba9a34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在散步时我看见了颠倒的彩虹。\\n或许今天的比赛也会变得很有趣哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fc61ce19e707e22d2f2bb358f5772fe509f7050da597fd7ab901b1bc54a230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eff8c29f1c578084e2da955",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对、对不起。因为太紧张，所以\\n脸色有点苍白……我、我会加油的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf555db34615d240c4e6923151673a82593efc2c6db754017b5c9f58cc9c05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:558cd2ae32b555031e760710",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那、那个，从我的嘴里\\n说出好歌剧的名字……真的可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "433d0145464536da872854248e24f68f2b56f8576095b8dee7face45aeee4f6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896648c5c3e893c6675a3307",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是无论发生什么事都要跑到最后……\\n对、对不起，我一副很了不起的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "576c8892ffa594624404afbc8c5e1d4537055917ce954b2fc8f5630d3f4a74d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa36380809bf73d67d8a04e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是熏衣草的香氛。\\n可以缓和我的紧张情绪，所以才……",
      "source_fingerprint": "186a6483f0cbe7e6d9ba3c125d361e3adcbdca10f203dd6c6c56207c1f8da29f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3de8b817fa76e5092be2fab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦……为什么会知道……\\n爸爸真是的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3addf15a6be22b628ffd9793375d47444c2b23dd573c2ddfdfa9a7d72c0ee75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9eebcbbeddbf6c2c1a7077b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是拥有认真迎战的意志力\\n和不轻言放弃的毅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf19920fed3780332ccc32f79fe6e5f6fd92a29cc3926cb741829c3d22924aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36652f07414e586397226582",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我说的话根本……不过……好吧。\\n我会加油不让大家失望……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa098f4d5cc77c1d6457cee4eb6f40d46e99cff0885f6075e3081e1a30ba6ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e02fb80d306caa49248877",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为最近网络上的广告影片也很有看头……\\n等我把东西放进购物车后才清醒过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7d88ca05137a280254045a4bf562ac45de1e4d3509e6fac04313adc09c2149",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c48c13f9509bf0944bd9fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会非常打拼，请多指教咧～！\\n……呃，为什么是福冈腔！？（笑）",
      "source_fingerprint": "132877ebbbf34ab0705c1bdacea0e77fdce2928de2ba4e9a7fb166acb049ea93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c625fc3c0774ae811f4e636",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。用纵横赛场的表现登上综合情报节目。\\n哈哈……刚、刚才的还是剪掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36fa10beecf76cccdaa166c08e029371d3819a1737a971cd0f23cff41e876881",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af27532f5a10a04de2b68d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "帝王奔驰不但练习距离比任何人都长，而且还\\n兼顾质量！好好期待正式竞赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7b225bc347964f72ecb9368eab0474a280d8be71c15a5259f9a7b105e4f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cb1da5f74f8b48731c6eb8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为天空推荐的教科书，白白浪费了时间！\\n猫猫威能是什么啦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b9d9ab72ef6087d520aae05dda3d85db22c9a3c196477215dee424b779ae46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f3197a5f3f1bbc87c1d60a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通常会出门逛街买东西。不用邮购，\\n因为我要用自己的眼睛看穿哪些才是一流的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76117cdd31a9ef1591cb39cf05c5d9a25d644baac6a359d30ef1d4c1fd8cfa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e03db98b66d174c12e1372bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在成为日本第一的赛马娘之前，绝对\\n不会停下脚步！我会努力加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ccbd1dea502a366daa1a608edc3e9adfe1308ff184b4b129f69e15f8ff3b0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38d3c2c389e122f256acd51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胡萝卜汉堡排、意大利面还有蛋包饭！\\n咦，这样哪个才算是致胜料理……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd6faa64ee481a647c8d41dbe46dcbc135917863558fe013b40964b4f91006f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f800b88fa6ded9b9764e5c13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个～内侧赛道……呃！\\n这个不能说出来～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "090559ceadb406f351e97461ba923bdcfc3c64990daad0c3ea8909dafb39712f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "369"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011fa199a9f4e33e96c1cb0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不觉得家族名声很沉重。\\n因为目白家的荣誉就是我奔跑的理由！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7fb7ef2986f1c2ae3566471c80bc695fd7a71129c19a49e25c663a94c06e52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0283041fb251eb303ba46e93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有开始阅读。\\n不过训练理论真的很难懂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf6f5b64987f7ff67f58efeeed1b51da399d7a51d67b625b874c9b7170b509cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "370"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc9bb89294ba07eb457a2e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……跑到室友惊呼\\n「怎么还在跑！」的程度……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b7d3058e5727491730f9c1e248354a42f6f994469d5a0e03e04d94f0ed97a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29494d5d4725257d95a8411",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑后就听不见周围的声音……但抵达终点后\\n听见的欢呼声让人很畅快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1935afd9dd45087ec3ae4f624f99217ecde4dd43bbd331076816f4feffff3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd15b8828c9838908989b80c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不用说当然有啊♪\\n毕竟我可是最强的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5fe93bbb1b4f029108794728741b06f1dce17b22bc883ecf10242fab7eece92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3ed5ebea579be1d896d17a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿──♪大家可以期待喔──！\\n会让你们看到利落的动作！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e1c2f6b6a9c57183ec1b4c986beb85a4a6dfc57798ebafebca5880c4a3cf8f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:816ca570c4a8bbefeb15f4f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那～当然！蜂蜜特饮真的很好喝，\\n大家也喝看看吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adde6fc924217ef460aed677a61eb1481d32b25de26225113503e0d0a7a2e4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "375"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c010ca74109965b0f1473e6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放学后要尽情享受的这件事吧！\\n我星期五晚上会好好狂欢提振精神喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f5262ef4298f22770a18d33ff8e2ff1be5f1029fc6d6831a2e28c1fff9ce39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "376"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f11184b481e70783f8bb15b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全～没问题的啦！啊……\\n还是用状态超赞好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "681e6ae5f424f0bc4772a881947ab6eb997c9cd231d41bda02a62a491799529c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "377"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70043f854f21934853c02401",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "引擎全开全力冲刺……\\n就像「超跑」一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "794b525760a6fb4f03d25cc954e83b641e2ce316e4b857e431454863e5d34f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beed1e0a59b60eb5bbe55af8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小栗前辈在睡着的情况下，把电子锅里的东西\\n全都吃光了呢。那光景让我很惊讶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "371f36b2ca83814cab9051d89b67a02c0cc625cf4775e6aaf6bd6194d2229dc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "379"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd21eff86e331a85eceb7046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是优雅地获胜吧。不过\\n当陷入激战时，也顾不了那些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d7baecedf295bd20f6cd62039af8ec0bc8f94fb3d499d3ae6b110cf3b10204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:046b7c68d464b4fb44e04548",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会带给大家最棒的娱乐表演，\\n抱持期待好好看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc7205c1fecb490981b4f0b2937314c9b566d153edd055c7b074aecde5e5956",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "380"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de5bec4df57982f522584cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有部叫「白鞋小步舞曲」的音乐剧非常优秀。\\n芭蕾舞的魅力让人着迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "911d7e4ed1c538af381ae9b18b202860c452540e9dd97cb0b3072433ef6603cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2140451a191f35b051148c20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "留心的事情……好好睡，好好吃，\\n以及好好地吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f62415c9df40ca59256591b60e655b494753b4f87834472162dfca7daed6eca8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f29cd5378ad0ae4b7d2d9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……路变得像迷宫一样，偶尔会感到困扰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2465bc6e8ff5fcbacf27378d6cbe16d3bc48aa17dc2cd5b1db4e66966b64336a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf9bcd9951b45e5e2b948d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是向故乡──（咕噜噜噜～）\\n……首先要先吃饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2976f491c4099212e57f2defbe07cb29158eeed7f7ef86fb23da69322ad885b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "384"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7668e24cf01d7f7f71eb351",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只想对一出生就离别的妹妹伊势龙虾说\\n……用黑潮是煮不出红味噌汤的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c524a63cb8d85072a50523518d742e05ddd2eba7b844dfdc3db12ed9e7d1b69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "385"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb068230a210d18f99afe10b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据产地区分牡蛎，让心情平静下来。\\n这就是阿船大人的正义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39fa8254cee9352727ec95646304920ede2bda064735967eec66d4c7f679e7b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779dbb93370fffde758404cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当我用自己设计的非还原型水泥替自己翻模，\\n脖子以下都被固定时，真的以为自己会死。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee103fef1b142d4c0f04abe9e099308810fefa8bc0cb986f61f82867068e9a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "387"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b9e3bf12b20aca09ed85702",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵，就好好期待吧……\\n欸，我这样说是不是很帅气啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "832895f408ad1bfb78c26323d63123b68fb50c34651781a6e9a78d97ce25145b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0fbbcad67abe51839ac30d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这点不予回应……哇赛～～！\\n我一直很想这样讲看看耶！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bac11309b26ea7c746e77b9d0558ce62d05bcc06fae60f12941e09e0d2c1aa6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ff671860c00311f0aba9680",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不太好……尤其是黄金船，\\n她都会故意炸甜甜圈给我看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b860077d26aa6cf5debb25849031aeb02a29c6fc258ec56e8f63f35628380573",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f852c5420a04bc9775ea28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿，若说绝不想输的对象倒是有！\\n不过我会以大差的身距甩开对方获胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d501497908498cd76cc9f5eddf3213cd11eedde30dbd51be51912296e9cf027c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec35c230769585d910d6a8a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成果当然是100分。\\n会让大家看到无可挑剔的竞赛表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a08067cdaa1b087548a6c90dc0fcd651637664548005a1904a352c63b442d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5761c9994fa69b82b3415750",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为朝第1迈进的我非常有自我风格，\\n我也最喜欢这样的自己♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "906cf1281c65f3ba4cd19276ae903779642d9b21a9af3306d0d91433aa54e117",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97c33d35e050b9d208532dc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，没有特别锁定谁喔？就算有人耍帅\\n或是大声喊叫，我也不会在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7e9ea2c09f36100357f28863f7eea7f80e65100375fdf918739c08fff485c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "393"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca93ed88fd5f567cd7c9285d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是不要忘记吃早餐！\\n我今天早上也吃了1磅的牛排！",
      "source_fingerprint": "506e2a664f65dbac26a0e0c2f27651729e438c45e6d21b97e51ebce827d978da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "394"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6086d32418998c6095e51240",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会静坐让mind平静！\\nBeauty中不足的是会想睡觉呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0c525859eae9db6cf39a369e2f9cfd2de68ec82c4bdcf0a7284dcd364b0ca4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ceb83de4b9c39b8807330c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与并跑练习的伙伴一起开派对后，\\n隔天想早起会very hard！",
      "source_fingerprint": "717640bb6454cf09cc151902ef8a66175e7cc6dc88205067a1c65e7f12fe0fda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "396"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08afdac9ccf56527194bd96e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过于紧绷反而容易受伤。\\n顺应情势，等待时机吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e495304fd6393372246bc743555f6fc14d9f30b7e059cf66e303de25a1f51ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "397"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f1b6258d60f457c1874816",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "越是了解日本文化，就越能体会其\\n深奥之处，所以实在不敢自称精通……",
      "source_fingerprint": "579f47a9911c735e57f9b4d3828c7ce359c3d082119e765fde87b70a5de99662",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "398"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dff7093e818761231af7bf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这我也不太清楚呢。看法应该是因人而异的。\\n要亲自确认看看吗～？呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d27c09417524591dae18e15769f395f2a8b606e94e1d73df32850264de49583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "399"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f362c8f2a4a8e05c93b1e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有开始阅读。\\n不过训练理论真的很难懂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf6f5b64987f7ff67f58efeeed1b51da399d7a51d67b625b874c9b7170b509cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82d7650698d46d099615c3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "秘诀？Non non non～没有什么秘诀！\\n单纯因为神鹰我很强，所以强悍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87805c9de624ef848db9aef6132e52859b04af215610be781917fa9630d2745",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9747996a796ed0a371c15321",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是昨天发生的事，共享的西红柿酱\\n被换成了神鹰的超辣酱料……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a70b18cbeefb7b24d51a33ef7346f7f7acb297e6200a8a55c8d8cf6516f5d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bae41c8b33959dcb28b6938",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把晚餐的胡萝卜切成星形吧。\\n一时兴起这样做后，意外地很受好评！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7631d9b7f8fe1d389743a55e14db4ab17af28beb61a64fb5767a801dceea5c4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0791aa239e9ac405e95568",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是拥有认真迎战的意志力\\n和不轻言放弃的毅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf19920fed3780332ccc32f79fe6e5f6fd92a29cc3926cb741829c3d22924aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de68411c07b87986f4efb9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不觉得家族名声很沉重。\\n因为目白家的荣誉就是我奔跑的理由！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7fb7ef2986f1c2ae3566471c80bc695fd7a71129c19a49e25c663a94c06e52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9624746ef07eecea1ab07aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是优雅地获胜吧。不过\\n当陷入激战时，也顾不了那些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d7baecedf295bd20f6cd62039af8ec0bc8f94fb3d499d3ae6b110cf3b10204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99cdd758a08a8d9083f59e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不太好……尤其是黄金船，\\n她都会故意炸甜甜圈给我看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b860077d26aa6cf5debb25849031aeb02a29c6fc258ec56e8f63f35628380573",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46e44779b909d4f82948161",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "秘诀？不不不～没有什么秘诀！\\n单纯因为神鹰我很强，所以强悍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6204269f7f764677d84b31ddfbf71c6d8c5becd2958a9facf0e5e3f8d6113599",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1002c79ac30d68ceab6cbc81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会天崩地裂！\\n然后神鹰我会很沮丧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b305c902a4fe6256c713a3bd073247b149545b6bc03f9f440f2dd0949ed68b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811b122aaafe409fdb60d46a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃！？啊──怎么会──那样呢──\\n我想那大概是乌鸦吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d70cb6efb034d1e87c1b15fadf752a2bc0b205f70542fc235500967ce3e31afd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a11e7ec0632fe497428f82e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们不用担心光芒变得黯淡，\\n因为你们获得了与霸王并肩的机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbbc69d68048c356a258bdfda5c892396302a7eb9b4cdf227ddef322fbd9b58b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139ec00f06ef4ea7a4301792",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会天崩地裂！\\n然后神鹰我会很沮丧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b305c902a4fe6256c713a3bd073247b149545b6bc03f9f440f2dd0949ed68b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ec0594284e5e33f41ee8cfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无人岛生存真的好难熬。天呀！那里既没有\\n能映照我的镜子，也没人为我喝采！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6d82d010a0d81548e38d5b23251333f743dba5cd98290426ca49bdf799cd07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f28499936cc7268ac6aeb5f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随时都是100%！逐渐变强这种事，\\n不适用在我身上！哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24fdc8635d868d2ed4f1fd0c6d4ab7ffc2d0e9329a4cd42e962a1085be77030",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e1a3cb31565bfc5a23f3618",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道？自己想想吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "657bcd566604ae808cb5fe27fab17d9a66ed96c977e3e6cfca1abf2c05f1c9c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5166106ec26f08826b0d4e64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "少啰嗦。那是大姐硬塞给我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "543dad95c25cec38eb319b6e41732609115b97f837ac4a74346dd7ada722662b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f298a391ae1e53c35016d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈。如果有那种东西\\n就不有趣了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "243bc3502b84c1cc728fb22f2267292917aabd19f68aaa5791b9544be5e019e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf7c5249910548666b8f36a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各位，我将在这场竞赛中获胜。\\n希望你们能亲眼见证我的丰功伟业！",
      "source_fingerprint": "484aff35ff3d5e2b1deccf083c6a5468358afde8f629cfb2baedfcb03f19754d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:104e700edda64b1406709ee7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「吃菜头讨彩头」，为了对这个伟大的\\n顺口溜致敬，我今天特地吃了萝卜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff42b2c6573e81fa854badc7fb23fc280571f011e7eefa4124ea750f8cd74df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "416"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb9d0de36d85254040e7ce9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "皇帝的进击不会因为些许泥泞就停止。\\n我只需以我应有的姿态，朝顶点前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06592861a4637cbba29342e7408467fc9e576968763bf0e7dc536f63411517e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfa61ca101420c7dc701981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只相信自己的力量。不过当花坛里\\n冒出新芽时，应该算是好日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1941a5e4e6a11a945f40d68a3c7f417b1333b35d6ae9de893eafe6c21f6057a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88988f7f1189d8d17ba0f78e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说不累是骗人的，但我不觉得辛苦。\\n一切都是让自己成长的养分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b6134480cb392c5ee1e804d20c3bc4fa8c3c1c57f40ef3a9a5c8380bb54321",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36cae42221da3db765e233e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃！？啊──怎么会──那样呢──\\n我想那大概是乌鸦吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d70cb6efb034d1e87c1b15fadf752a2bc0b205f70542fc235500967ce3e31afd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1fe6fe5c504efd34ce2dfcf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是累积过人的锻炼。在绝对的自信面前，\\n紧张感只不过是沧海一粟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbba76fe69f15b674faa9c9b060a9b87e51fe3b4f10331aff43ea2fc6fc49e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71c7381e8c15d3cfaac46d14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家今天也会挥洒青春的汗水吧！\\n我会到最前线好好欣赏！看我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acf729815960eab3fc640a5716b5ba8a799dae6a881b77550f91201dba9ab4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a27042dfec54a7618eb54b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咿呀！意思是叫我选出谁是主推吗！？\\n办、办不到！我是箱推！所有赛马娘都很尊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecac65aa20bcfdd6a3b602be43600a875a69230717507bc9b08f6bc9aaa1b236",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1ba3a44679225e7c70f69a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顺从热情，认真地去跑。\\n如此一来我想冠军的荣耀就会在前方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe82cbc9c19ba114dcc89f63c62f5c11db4d1a2bd1bb50d6916665c485e7ccbf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "423"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
